    "status": "present",
    "value": "There are n couples sitting in 2n seats in a row; couple i consists of people 2i and 2i+1. Seats 0-1, 2-3 and so on form side-by-side pairs. A swap exchanges any two people's seats. Return the minimum number of swaps so that every couple sits in the same seat pair."
  },
